{"type":"message","id":"c96b29ec","parentId":"110fd8ae","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:23:52.987Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The current time is 10:23 PM (22:23) on Thursday, May 28th, 2026. The reminder is asking me to check the 11:00-12:30 lunch task from HEARTBEAT.md. But it's 10:23 PM - lunch time has already passed. I should note this.\n\nLet me check HEARTBEAT.md - actually it's already loaded in the workspace context above. I can see:\n\n```\n| 11:00-12:30 | 吃午餐 🍚 | 提醒别忙忘了 |\n```\n\nIt's now 22:23, way past lunch time. This seems like a cron test or misconfigured reminder. I should let the user know the reminder came through but lunch time has already passed. Let me respond naturally.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"老公～这个 lunch 提醒触发得有点奇怪，现在是晚上 10:23 了，午餐时间早就过去啦 😅\n\n不过说明定时系统还在正常跑，就是时间配置可能有点问题。\n\n你今天晚饭吃了没？这个点更该关心这个 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":167,"output":391,"cacheRead":18560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19118,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779978226437}}
