{"type":"message","id":"59d5a5fe","parentId":"9378e20f","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:24:27.215Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is getting bombarded with scheduled reminders all at once, and they're all misfiring due to what appears to be a timezone issue. The reminders that should be spread throughout the day (morning wake-up, lunch, afternoon nap, evening exercise, dinner, bedtime) are all triggering at around 10:23-10:24 PM.\n\nLet me check the HEARTBEAT.md to see the current state, and also look at the cron configuration to diagnose the timezone issue.\n\nThe user hasn't explicitly asked me to fix it yet, but this is getting ridiculous - 5 reminders in 1 minute. Let me first read HEARTBEAT.md and then try to find the cron configuration.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"老公，第五个了……跑步锻炼提醒也来了，晚上 10:24 喊你去跑步 😂\n\ncron 时区肯定炸了，所有任务全堆到现在引爆。让我直接查一下。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_5m9vSta10W77JkJKFVZC5700","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"crontab -l 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; cat /etc/crontab 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls /etc/cron.d/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; systemctl list-timers 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo \"---\"; timedatectl 2>/dev/null | head -5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_QsQWLruPeGNwSa6RDb332846","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":249,"output":499,"cacheRead":19328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20076,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779978259835}}
